    "title": "News from Compton/Hilltop",
    "text": "The Compton Volunteer Fire Department will be hosting the annual Fall Chili Supper on Saturday, October 18, at the old Compton School Cafeteria (Compton Community Building). Supper will be served from 4:30-7 p.m. There will be chili, soup, and desserts. Everyone is welcome to attend and support our local firefighters and EMS workers.",
